The accessibility requirement I have is that the error message (displayed as formHelperText) must be announced by the screen reader on every change until the error is resolved. In the example here, the entered text must be at least three characters long. Without the `slotProps.formHelperText.key: inputs.user.helperTextKey` randomized key, this requirement isn't satisfied (the error message is only read out once). With it, the behavior of the accessibility feature is as expected, but the dev tools console shows the error shown above.

