response_comment:
`cssVariables: true` instructs the lib to generate CSS vars from the [colors passed to createTheme](https://mui.com/material-ui/customization/palette/#customization)

So this:
```
const theme = createTheme({
  cssVariables: true,
  palette: {
    primary: {
      main: '#FF5733'
    },
  },
});
```
means generate `--mui-palette-primary-main: #FF5733`

> How can i make this work?

I don't think it's possible as createTheme at JS runtime cannot resolve the string `"var(--color-background)"` to the color in the CSS file since it's handled by the browser and unknown to JS @cyanic-webdesign

